msgid "Could not upload file."
msgstr "Non se puido cargar o ficheiro."

#: includes/forms/errorstrings.php:26
msgid "There were errors while resetting permissions."
msgstr "Houbo erros ao restablecer permisos."

#: includes/forms/errorstrings.php:36
msgid "Could not set write permissions."
msgstr "Non se puideron establecer permisos de escritura."

#: includes/forms/errorstrings.php:21
msgid "Could not delete %s file."
msgstr "Non se puido eliminar o ficheiro %s."

#: includes/forms/errorstrings.php:19
msgid "A closing PHP tag was detected in Child theme functions file so \"Parent Stylesheet Handling\" option was not configured. Closing PHP at the end of the file is discouraged as it can cause premature HTTP headers. Please edit <code>functions.php</code> to remove the final <code>?&gt;</code> tag and click \"Generate/Rebuild Child Theme Files\" again."
msgstr "Detectouse unha etiqueta PHP de peche no ficheiro de funcións do tema Fillo polo que non se configurou a opción \"Manexo de follas de estilo do pai\". O peche de PHP ao final do ficheiro está desaconsellado, xa que pode provocar cabeceiras HTTP prematuras. Edite <code>functions.php</code> para eliminar a etiqueta <code>?&gt;</code> o final e faga clic de novo en \"Xerar/Reconstruír Ficheiros do Tema Fillo\"."

